  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural Heritage without Borders 2012-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kulturarv utan Gr&#xe4;nser 2012-2015 (KOS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Cultural Heritage without Borders (CHwB) arbetar i konflikt- och      postkonfliktl&#xe4;nder med sambandet mellan kulturarv, f&#xf6;rsoning och      m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. CHwB uppdrag &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka det civila          samh&#xe4;llet genom lokala och regionala kulturarvsprojekt i omr&#xe5;den som  ber&#xf6;rs av konflikter, katastrofer eller samh&#xe4;llsomvandlingar. Sida    ger st&#xf6;d till CHwB&apos;s program p&#xe5; v&#xe4;stra Balkan under 2012-2015.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objectives of the proposed CHwB programmes in the WB      region 2012-2015 are among others to, create conditions for the       enjoyment of cultural freedom and cultural diversity, create          conditions for reconciliation as a prerequisite for peace and         democracy with respect for human rights, and, create conditions for   democratic practices on community level.</narrative>
  </description>
